---
import { ArrowDown, ArrowRight, Route } from '@lucide/astro';
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  className="project-memory-routing"
  figureNumber="04"
  title="Route, then narrow"
  status="Current human-authored workflow"
  caption="A human-authored entry point and task scope guide selection; the repository does not detect relevance automatically. Other project memory remains available for other work."
>
  <div class="routing-flow">
    <section>
      <span class="label">Task</span>
      <strong class="figure-node-feature">Change publication behavior</strong>
      <p>The task supplies scope—not every document in the repository.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="flow-marker" aria-hidden="true">
      <ArrowDown class="arrow-mobile" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
      <ArrowRight class="arrow-desktop" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
    </div>

    <section class="router">
      <Route class="route-icon" size={20} strokeWidth={1.6} aria-hidden="true" />
      <code class="figure-support">AGENTS.md</code>
      <p>Read the constitution, relevant spec, plan/tasks, and ADRs; do not fabricate; update durable requirements when they change.</p>
      <span class="routing-note">Explicit routing</span>
    </section>

    <div class="flow-marker" aria-hidden="true">
      <ArrowDown class="arrow-mobile" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
      <ArrowRight class="arrow-desktop" size={16} strokeWidth={1.6} />
    </div>

    <section class="selected">
      <span class="label">Selected context</span>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span>Project-wide factual guardrails</li>
        <li><span>02</span>Publication-gating specification and decisions</li>
        <li><span>03</span>Relevant implementation surfaces</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="selection-boundary">Selected by explicit task scope and maintained instructions—not an automated relevance system.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  .project-memory-routing :global(p), .project-memory-routing :global(ol), .project-memory-routing :global(li) { margin: 0; }
  .project-memory-routing :global(ol) { padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .routing-flow { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; }
  section { min-width: 0; }
  .label, code, li span, .routing-note, .selection-boundary { font-family: var(--font-mono-ui); }
  .label, .routing-note { display: block; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--research-diagram-label, 0.625rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  section > strong, code { display: block; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  code { border: 0 !important; background: transparent !important; padding: 0 !important; color: var(--text-primary) !important; white-space: normal !important; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  section > p:not(.selection-boundary) { margin-top: 0.55rem !important; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--research-diagram-copy, 0.875rem); line-height: 1.6; }
  .flow-marker { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent); }
  .arrow-desktop { display: none; }
  .route-icon { color: var(--accent); }
  .router { position: relative; padding-block: 0.2rem; }
  .routing-note { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .selected { border-left: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-left: 1rem; }
  ol { display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; margin-top: 0.8rem !important; }
  li { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--research-diagram-copy, 0.875rem); line-height: 1.5; }
  li span { display: inline-block; min-width: 1.8rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: var(--research-diagram-label, 0.625rem); }
  .selection-boundary { margin-top: 0.9rem !important; border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle); padding-top: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--research-diagram-label, 0.625rem); line-height: 1.55; }

  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .routing-flow { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 1.15fr) 2.5rem minmax(0, 1.15fr); align-items: center; gap: 0; }
    .arrow-mobile { display: none; }
    .arrow-desktop { display: block; }
    .routing-note { position: absolute; top: 0; right: -0.25rem; margin-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
